.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH swarm-maintainers 1  "swarm 0.2.2" "Swarmgit manual"
.SH NAME
swarm\-maintainers \- Add or remove maintainers, who may publish without the root key
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswarm maintainers\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add or remove maintainers, who may publish without the root key
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
swarm\-maintainers\-add(1)
Authorize a key (root key only), optionally limited to ref globs
.TP
swarm\-maintainers\-remove(1)
Remove a maintainer (root key only)
.TP
swarm\-maintainers\-list(1)
List the maintainers
